Subject: An imposing hooded villain in ornate forged dark gunmetal Latverian armor, shown from the shoulders up in an intense three-quarter close-up. He wears a deep [emerald green] woven fabric hood casting heavy shadow over his face. His metal mask features engraved filigree, rivets, angular plates, and an elaborate spiked spectacle-like eye frame across the visor with two glowing reflective lenses: the left glowing green and the right glowing gold. A single human eye glints sharply in the shadow above. Glossy black shoulder pauldron with gold filigree crest trim, and a dark green gloved or armored hand partially visible in the lower right foreground.

Layout and Graphics: A broad diagonal dark green paint stroke sweeps behind the portrait from upper center-left toward lower right. On the lower center-left, exactly one small rectangular inset photo framed in a thin gold border shows a macro crop of the spiked dual-color lenses. Halftone print grain, subtle distress, and film scratches throughout.

